{"id": "EUVD-2026-107238", "enisaUuid": "8fedb0fb-8b8c-3c2f-ab57-bdf91b379d3d", "description": "ZenTao PMS before 22.3 contains an authorization bypass vulnerability in commonModel::isOpenMethod() that lets logged-in users skip group-based ACL checks for any method containing 'ajax'. Minimal-privilege users can call methods like task.ajaxGetByID, system.ajaxDBAuthUrl and admin.ajaxChangeTableEngine to read data, obtain database credentials, trigger CI jobs and alter tables.", "datePublished": "2026-10-21T12:39:47", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T20:08:00", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/easysoft/zentaopms/issues/181", "https://github.com/easysoft/zentaopms/commit/ac484f3b01c0f84002391a344d99dd2993692f49", "https://github.com/easysoft/zentaopms/releases/tag/zentaopms_22.3_20260707", "https://github.com/easysoft/zentaopms/blob/zentaopms_22.2_20260527/module/common/model.php#L446-L463", "https://github.com/easysoft/zentaopms/blob/zentaopms_22.2_20260527/module/system/control.php#L454-L474", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/zentao-pms-before-22.3-authorization-bypass-via-ajax-controller-methods"], "aliases": ["GHSA-crpg-r4ww-5jx4", "CVE-2026-114391"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.3, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "b9a77835-a081-31e1-a34f-d36b68d55317", "product": {"name": "zentaopms", "vendor": {"name": "easysoft"}}, "product_version": "0 <22.3"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "327fd486-c4ce-357c-b719-0c5a58820dde", "vendor": {"name": "easysoft"}}], "isExploited": false}